patrone-software (0.1.4) resolute; urgency=medium

  * The Craft apps show and install: adds Patrone's app index
    (billsecond/patrone-app-index on GitHub Pages) and Flathub as system
    Flatpak remotes. The index holds only each app's listing and a link to
    the tarball on its own GitHub release, which Flatpak downloads when the
    app is installed; Flathub has the runtime they run on.

 -- William Daugherty <31995458+billsecond@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 27 Oct 2026 13:05:00 -0500

