patrone-software (0.1.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Patrone's picks are the Craft apps, in place of the placeholder:
    PhotoCraft, PdfCraft, FilmCraft, WordCraft, LightCraft, VectorCraft,
    EffectCraft, CADCraft, GridCraft, DesignCraft, DeckCraft, SoundCraft,
    FigCraft, the Craft Launcher, ScreenGrabCraft and MailCraft. They show
    once they're in a Flatpak repository GNOME Software reads; until then
    the well-known apps of the placeholder fill Explore.
  * List Blender and VLC by Ubuntu's archive's IDs too, so Editor's Choice
    shows without Flathub.

